## DC 8 — TSC Not in Scope (physical security line)

**FROM**
> Physical security is carved out as part of the Microsoft Azure subservice organization (see DC 7); Normain operates fully remotely and maintains no on-premises infrastructure.

**TO**
> Physical security is carved out as part of the Microsoft Azure and AWS subservice organizations (see DC 7); Normain operates fully remotely and maintains no on-premises infrastructure.

